{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":102774,"seasonNumber":2},"checkedAt":1793332353339,"status":"ok","value":{"seasonNumber":2,"name":{"value":"Stagione 2","language":"it-IT"},"year":2025,"episodeCount":12,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fuWMTPgBeYNzBO8POw6Ef3L60Dx.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"5710808","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Mirai Asahina leads an extremely ordinary life as a college student, while secretly—and magically—helping people as Maho Girl. However, one day, a giant monster appears in Tsunagi Town, where Mirai lives!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-01-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/Gr4BW9jgIuPPx3MIKMk1rquV6Q.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Gr4BW9jgIuPPx3MIKMk1rquV6Q.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/102774/season/2/episode/1"},{"id":"5887127","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Mirai and Liko sense a new crisis looming after hearing Ire's cryptic words. They also meet a mysterious girl named Hisui, who seems to strikingly resemble Kotoha Hanami.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-01-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/osrmT5xZ9kRTkD83tWqeOcwqyaN.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/osrmT5xZ9kRTkD83tWqeOcwqyaN.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/102774/season/2/episode/2"},{"id":"5887128","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"When the time Ire spoke of had finally come, Mirai saw a vision of Cure Miracle and Cure Magical fallen in a wasteland and Hisui being taken away by Ire. Mirai and Liko think this might be what happens in the future.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-01-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/o9ipM7wfb425mnScnR1e9sNKpOu.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o9ipM7wfb425mnScnR1e9sNKpOu.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/102774/season/2/episode/3"},{"id":"5887130","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Mirai and Liko resolved again to thwart Ire's devious plot and protect Hisui. They decide to track down his whereabouts using the vision Mirai saw of Ire standing in front of some bookshelves as a clue. Just then, a request comes in for the Maho Girl.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-02-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cjnPK8MgPUXOLFOD0gfPiqJYRUP.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cjnPK8MgPUXOLFOD0gfPiqJYRUP.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/102774/season/2/episode/4"},{"id":"5887131","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Each day, Hisui is growing more and more at an unbelievable rate. To avoid suspicion from those around them, Mirai and Liko take Hisui and move into an apartment that Liko has rented.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-02-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6Wsw0cCN485Apue5JYDNCl6hUm5.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6Wsw0cCN485Apue5JYDNCl6hUm5.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/102774/season/2/episode/5"},{"id":"5970052","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"To their astonishment, it is revealed that the ominous vision seen by Mirai, Liko, and Mofurun is set to come true the very next day. To change this future, Mirai and Liko decide to leave Hisui in the Magicless World and journey together to the Magic World.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-02-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qnt3MIS3kuRTNwAnLVMLdBIdtMZ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qnt3MIS3kuRTNwAnLVMLdBIdtMZ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/102774/season/2/episode/6"},{"id":"5971519","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Time Beast Chronosto has revealed its form, and its power has turned Ire to stone. What’s more, Kotoha has reverted to her old form, and Hisui has disappeared. Mirai and the others are filled with questions and look to Kotoha for answers about what happened.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-02-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/93Yh39abAj9EPhAw6GW3Z9fdN5U.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/93Yh39abAj9EPhAw6GW3Z9fdN5U.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/102774/season/2/episode/7"},{"id":"5971521","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"As a result of the investigation in the Magic World, Ire's backstory gradually became clearer. Furthermore, Mirai and friends learned about the relationship between Kotoha and Hisui from Chikurun, who came as a messenger from the Fairy Village.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-03-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3q6Gyz0XJywhAeCNNgT8ImfD8lb.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3q6Gyz0XJywhAeCNNgT8ImfD8lb.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/102774/season/2/episode/8"},{"id":"5971522","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"津成木町の住人を次々に襲い、石像に変えていくクロノウストの影。事情を知らない人々の間でも、それは「謎の失踪事件」として少しずつ話題になっていた。駆け出し記者のケイは、事件について調べる中でみらいとリコ、そしてことはが関係していくことに気づき、ジュンやエミリーと一緒にみらいたちに会いに行こうと考える。一方そのころ、みらいたちは魔法界を訪れ、ことはがキュアフェリーチェに変身したことを校長に報告していた。事件を解決するにはクロノウストを止めるしかない――そう考えた一同は、かつてはプリキュアと敵対していたバッティたちとも協力して、クロノウストに立ち向かう決意を新たにする。だが、その直後、今度は魔法界にクロノウストの影が出現。プリキュアはバッティたちと協力してクロノウストの影を退けようとするが、増殖したクロノウストの影は魔法界中を石像に変えてしまうのだった……。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-03-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yPWgKVEhVnqCi4PYcqIpf5lnQkG.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yPWgKVEhVnqCi4PYcqIpf5lnQkG.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/102774/season/2/episode/9"},{"id":"6029457","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"増殖したクロノウストの影によって、石化された魔法界の人々。さらに、ジュンやケイ、エミリーまでもが石にされていたことを知ったみらいたちは、次なる被害を防ぐべく、再びナシマホウ界へ戻ることにする。ヤモーの魔法でみらいたちが津成木町に移動すると、どうやら魔法界が襲われたのと同じ頃にナシマホウ界でも新たな失踪事件が起きていたらしい。なぜクロノウストは二つの世界で活動できるのか……？みんなで考えを巡らせる中、みらいは一つの可能性を思いつく。クロノウストは魔法界と津成木町の間にある「狭間の世界」に潜伏しているのではないか、と――。一同が狭間の世界に行ってみると、力を集め終えたクロノウストが今まさに目覚めようとしているところだった。みらいたちは変身してその覚醒を阻もうとするが、ヤモーがプリキュアを裏切ろうとしたことで戦況は混迷を極めていく。そんな中、クロノウストが「時の全てが停止する」と呟いて……？","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-03-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bsm9dVpuh9cGxmhZHhJZ29ejuKV.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bsm9dVpuh9cGxmhZHhJZ29ejuKV.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/102774/season/2/episode/10"},{"id":"6029461","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With Chronosto’s profound words, a giant cocoon appears in the sky above the Magicless World.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-03-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/scMaQY3YzhWOdZWotOb89hwGX80.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/scMaQY3YzhWOdZWotOb89hwGX80.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/102774/season/2/episode/11"},{"id":"6029464","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Mirai, Liko, Kotoha, and Mofurun lost their memories as the cost of escaping from the past. They drifted through their memories as they were unable to remember each other. What is it that they saw there...?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-03-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nJXVePJGWa1Ef2tKS0nZNPKkpBo.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nJXVePJGWa1Ef2tKS0nZNPKkpBo.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/102774/season/2/episode/12"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/102774/season/2"},"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793332353339,"status":"ok"},"2":{"checkedAt":1793332353339,"status":"ok"},"3":{"checkedAt":1793332353339,"status":"ok"},"4":{"checkedAt":1793332353339,"status":"ok"},"5":{"checkedAt":1793332353339,"status":"ok"},"6":{"checkedAt":1793332353339,"status":"ok"},"7":{"checkedAt":1793332353339,"status":"ok"},"8":{"checkedAt":1793332353339,"status":"ok"},"9":{"checkedAt":1793332353339,"status":"ok"},"10":{"checkedAt":1793332353339,"status":"ok"},"11":{"checkedAt":1793332353339,"status":"ok"},"12":{"checkedAt":1793332353339,"status":"ok"}}}
